{"id":"rdb-ec8ec2","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"One canonical latest benchmark results file; archive historical reports","description":"Benchmark results are spread over four documents (`docs/benchmark.md` \"Reference comparison\", `performance.md`, `m4-bench.md`, `m4.3-bench.md`) plus four scorecard JSONs, and the README quotes numbers from them. The current \"reference comparison\" combines runs at four different revisions (one with a dirty tree), all before the GMS upgrade and the rdb-3745e6/rdb-e472aa fixes.\n\nEstablish:\n- `docs/benchmarks/latest.md` as the single canonical place for current results;\n- `docs/benchmarks/history/` for past reports, preserved as artifacts of the repository state they measured;\n- a documented publishing process;\n- README numbers sourced from latest.md.\n\nThe fresh measurement itself is a separate issue, run after rdb-bc42f6.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":2,"sort_order":"a1","labels":["task","docs"]},"created_at":"2026-09-28T10:41:57.916422Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.283 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"rdb-6ae82d","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Refresh docs/benchmarks/latest.md with a full run at one clean commit","description":"After rdb-bc42f6 merges (it changes the snapshot fast path that read latency depends on), run the full scorecard at a single clean commit of `main` and publish it through the rdb-ec8ec2 process:\n\n- `make bench` for native-git and journal, on the same machine and filesystem, sequentially;\n- MySQL 8 and Dolt baselines via `make bench-external` in Docker (the user starts Docker Desktop beforehand);\n- archive the current latest.md into history, write the new latest.md with the commit, date and environment, commit the raw JSON, and update the README table.\n\nAll four runs must record the same revision with an empty `working_tree_status`.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":2,"sort_order":"a2","dependencies":[{"source_id":"rdb-6ae82d","target_id":"rdb-bc42f6","kind":"blocked_by"},{"source_id":"rdb-6ae82d","target_id":"rdb-ec8ec2","kind":"depends_on"}],"labels":["task","docs"]},"created_at":"2026-09-28T10:42:06.091361Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.283 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
