{"id":"rdb-22f505","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"dbbench: record external server version and list correctness failures","description":"Prerequisite for rdb-6ae82d, which requires latest.md to state server versions and not present failed rows as comparable.\n\n- External mode records `SELECT VERSION()` as `server_version` in the JSON report and prints it in the report header.\n- `printReport` lists each row's `verification_error` and first error under the table (\"Correctness failures:\"), so a FAIL status always comes with its reason. The table's Status column already marks those rows FAIL.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":1,"sort_order":"a3","dependencies":[{"source_id":"rdb-22f505","target_id":"rdb-6ae82d","kind":"blocks"}],"labels":["task"]},"created_at":"2026-09-28T11:17:08.429336Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.283 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
