{"id":"rdb-ff5432","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-691161e1-ccb4-4d7e-af11-c18d782f6dba","text":"Ready for review.\n\n**Fix:** `*table` now implements `sql.TemporaryTable` (`IsTemporary() == false`, `engine/catalog.go`). go-mysql-server's read-only check no longer dereferences a nil interface, and writes are rejected with `ErrReadOnlyTransaction` (MySQL 1792).\n\n**Tests:**\n- `engine/readonly_test.go`: `INSERT`, `UPDATE`, `DELETE` and `INSERT … SELECT` rejected; `SELECT` works; nothing persisted; the session writes again after `COMMIT`. It panicked before the fix.\n- `server/readonly_test.go`: error 1792 over the wire on a pinned connection; the connection keeps working.\n\n**Findings:**\n- Over the wire before the fix, GMS recovered the panic, so the server survived. The client got a generic error, not 1792.\n- Writes in a read-only transaction that also read `dual` or `information_schema` don't panic, so no separate bug was filed.\n\n**Docs:** `sql.md` read-only transaction entry rewritten; `testing.md` gap removed and coverage added.\n\n`make test` and `make lint` pass."},"created_at":"2026-10-01T11:10:57.404957Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.286 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
