{"id":"rdb-5c1808","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Persist views (CREATE VIEW) in snapshots","description":"RepoDB doesn't support views: rdb-5f12a3 makes `CREATE VIEW` fail with a clear error instead of keeping a session-local view that is silently lost.\n\nPersisted views would need:\n- `database` to implement `sql.ViewDatabase` (`CreateView`, `DropView`, `GetViewDefinition`, `AllViews`);\n- view definitions stored in the snapshot manifest (or a catalog object), covering both native-git and journal modes (journal record kind or typed edit);\n- sync/merge rules for views: concurrent create/replace/drop of the same view name are conflicts, and a view referencing a table dropped on the other side;\n- `SHOW CREATE VIEW`, `information_schema.views` and `SHOW FULL TABLES` reflecting stored views;\n- `docs/sql.md` and `docs/architecture.md` updates.","status":"BACKLOG","sort_order":"ad","dependencies":[{"source_id":"rdb-5c1808","target_id":"rdb-5f12a3","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-10-01T11:28:34.206529Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.286 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
